ForceInfo0
{
	ForceToReplace	FP_SEE
	Icon		"gfx/marvel/spidersense"
	ForcePowerName	"Findsman Precognition"
}


description	"Gand Findsman

Stocky force attuned bounty hunters. Their strong exo-Skeleton and biology assists them in resisting the elements and blaster fire.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Gand Shockprod Staff (Staff/Purple)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Shocks/tracks on hit
- Ammonia Bombs (2/5) (Flechette 4)
-- Poisons/tracks/slows on det
-- 75% more damage
-- Secondary fire only
- W-90 Concussion Rifle (T-21 1)
-- Pushes/Pulses on hit
-- 20% faster RoF
-- 10% less dmg
-- 75% more FP damage
-- Mag reload
- Automatic Slugthrower (Repeater 1)
-- 100% more velocity
-- 50% less dmg
-- 25% less fp dmg
-- 5% slower RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Sonic Screamer Grenade (1)
-- Disarms on det

^8Attributes:
- Getup (2)
- Stamina (2)
- Close Combat (2)
- Elemental Resist (2)
- Healing (1)
- Findsman Precognition (Miraluka 1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Force Sense Immunity
- Reinforcement (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Respirator (Underwater Breathing)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS2]
- Ammonia Darts (8) ^3[Melee CS3]
-- Poisons/slows on hit
- Binoculars ^3[CS4]"
